    "objective": "Build source-driven canonical reconciliation candidates\n\nRF-17: replace arbitrary alphabetical first-50 reconciliation slices with reproducible source terms, FTS matches, glossary aliases, graph neighbours, page families, scores, reasons, and index digest.",
